@template brisk
// Head writer 4: career lines in the brisk voice (see career.lines for the flags).

== career.missed
? tier>=colleague
- You weren't on shift. Problem? Tell me. Then fix it.

== worried.chief
? tier>=friend
- Chief's had her word. Good. Now: eight sharp. Every day.

== worried.captain
? tier>=friend
- Ready room. That's serious. Eight o'clock tomorrow. No excuses.   #serious

== worried.last
? tier>=friend
- Listen. One shift. Tomorrow. That's all it takes to stop this.   #serious

== career.up
? tier>=friend
- Saw your name on the board. Turned in. Good.

== farewell.eve
? tier>=friend
- Tomorrow. Right. I'm not good at this. I'm sorry. Truly.   #serious

== farewell.day
? tier>=friend
- Go well, {nick}. Do it right next time. You can.   #warm
